        "order": 11,
        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "豫旺堡—同心—会宁（红十五军团骑兵团奔袭会宁）",
          "en": "Yuwangbu–Tongxin–Huining (15th Army Corps cavalry raid)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1936 年 9 月 30 日，红一方面军第十五军团直属骑兵团由宁夏同心县出发奔袭会宁县城，10 月 2 日凌晨发起攻击，不到两小时全歼守敌，占领会宁县城，为三大主力会师打开接应阵地。红十五军团主力随后向会宁东南、打拉池方向前进，控制会宁至静宁沿线要点。路线为示意，待按行军日志细化。",
          "en": "On 30 September 1936 the cavalry regiment directly under the First Front Army’s 15th Army Corps set out from Tongxin, Ningxia, to raid Huining town; it attacked before dawn on 2 October, destroyed the garrison in under two hours, and took the town, opening the staging ground for the three main forces’ link-up. The corps’ main force then moved southeast of Huining toward Dalachi, controlling the Huining–Jingning line. The route is schematic and awaits refinement from march logs."
        },
